{'symbol': 'EXC', 'date': '2023-05-10 13:04:00', 'title': 'EXELON UTILITIES RECOGNIZED WITH ENERGY STAR® PARTNER OF THE YEAR AWARDS', 'text': "CHICAGO--(BUSINESS WIRE)--EXELON'S (NASDAQ: EXC) ENERGY DELIVERY COMPANIES, ATLANTIC CITY ELECTRIC (ACE), BALTIMORE GAS AND ELECTRIC (BGE), COMED, DELMARVA POWER (DPL), PHILADELPHIA ENERGY COMPANY (PECO) AND POTOMAC ELECTRIC POWER COMPANY (PEPCO), WERE EACH RECOGNIZED WITH THE ENERGY STAR® PARTNER OF THE YEAR AWARD, FOR THE SIGNIFICANT IMPACT THEIR ENERGY EFFICIENCY PROGRAMS ARE HAVING IN HELPING REDUCE GREENHOUSE GAS EMISSIONS AND PROVIDE MILLIONS OF DOLLARS IN SAVINGS FOR THE COMPANY'S MORE T."}